      <title>LongCat-Flash-Thinking发布</title>
      <link>https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/zh/ChangeLog.html#%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC-2025-09-22</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/zh/ChangeLog.html#%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC-2025-09-22?li=1</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>版本: 2025-09-22 <a href="https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/zh/ChangeLog.html#版本-2025-09-22">​</a></h2>
<h3>LongCat-Flash-Thinking发布 <a href="https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/zh/ChangeLog.html#longcat-flash-thinking发布">​</a></h3>
<ul><li>LongCat-Flash-Thinking正式发布，并同步开源。该模型是一款深度思考模型，可以在LongCat Chat中免费对话，也可以通过指定 <code>model=LongCat-Flash-Thinking</code>调用。</li><li>LongCat Chat地址：<a href="https://longcat.chat/">https://longcat.chat/</a></li><li>调用指南请参考: <a href="https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/zh/api-docs">LongCat API 开放平台接口文档</a></li><li>开源平台地址Hugging Face：<a href="https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Flash-Thinking">https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Flash-Thinking</a>Github：<a href="https://github.com/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Flash-Thinking">https://github.com/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Flash-Thinking</a></li></ul>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
